; Comments added by Becka after survey trip with Julian on 25/10/09
; Extensions go off very low on left taking all the water flowing out of East inlet and other inlet by concrete dam
; Extensions go off just before stoop/crawl starts, about 15m before reach concrete dam
; Reading from boulder at start of stoop/crawl looking down passage towards dam is 063 compass -01 clino
